```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Action Occurs] --> B[Create LedgerEntry]
    B --> C[Get Previous Entry Hash]
    C --> D[prevHash = entryHash of last entry\nor 000...0 for genesis]
    D --> E[canonicalJSON of payload]
    E --> F[SHA-256 of prevHash + canonicalJSON]
    F --> G[entryHash = computed hash]
    G --> H[Append to Ledger]
    H --> I[INSERT-only — no UPDATE/DELETE]
    I --> J[Verify Chain Button]
    J --> K[Recompute Each Hash]
    K --> L{All Hashes Match?}
    L -->|Yes| M[Chain Valid — Green]
    L -->|No| N[First Break Found — Red]
    N --> O[Downstream Entries Marked Broken]
    O --> P[Tamper Detected]
```
